{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fb5eb5f0-1a8c-823b-8082-acb2ed477326",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T13:13:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Barbara Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:09:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Happy New Year, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:09:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. Happy New Year. I'm calling about my Christmas tree. Basically it was supposed to get picked up and it's still sitting at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me see what I can do. Can I get the address where the tree is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:10:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "217 Malbone Road. North End, up toward the Middletown line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:10:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "217 Malbone Road. Got it. And when did you put the tree out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:10:11-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Last Monday, so the twenty-ninth. Basically I put it out the night before because the schedule said tree pickup was that week. And nothing. Then this morning I'm looking out and it's still there, plus my regular trash didn't get picked up either."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:10:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, so the trash was missed as well. Is that today, Monday, that you expected the trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:10:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, today. And that's the second miss in a row. The week before, around Christmas, they skipped us too. So that's two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:10:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. So let me repeat it back. Two missed trash pickups in a row at 217 Malbone, last one today, and a Christmas tree out since the twenty-ninth. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:10:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it. And the bin was out by seven. I checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:11:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Was it at the curb, in front, not blocked by a car or a snowbank?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:11:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's right at the curb, same spot as always. Nothing parked there. Honestly it's a pretty clear street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:11:19-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. With the holidays, the schedules got shifted around, and sometimes a route gets pushed a day or two. Some trees are collected on a separate run too, so that may be why yours is still out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:11:34-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but basically that doesn't explain the trash. The trash is not a tree. And I'm not hauling a tree to the dump myself. It's like six feet tall. Back when I was a kid we'd go to Fort Adams on school field trips and that tree's basically taller than some of the cannons I remember."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:11:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Well, I'll take that as a big tree then. Let me look at the route notes for Malbone Road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:12:05-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:12:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm seeing that this week's trash route on your side of the street shows as running behind. The truck may still come through this afternoon or tomorrow. I'd leave the bin where it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:12:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So leave it out. Okay. And the tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:12:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leave the tree there too. I'm going to put in a request so the crew knows both were missed at 217 Malbone Road. Can I have a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:12:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0150."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:12:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0150. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:12:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Barbara Thurston. Thurston, T-H-U-R-S-T-O-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:12:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Barbara. So that's the missed trash and the tree, at 217 Malbone, phone ending in 0150. Someone should follow up by tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:12:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By tomorrow. Okay. And if it's not picked up by then, I just call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:13:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, call back and mention this request. If you tell them you called Monday, they can find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:13:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Thanks. I'd just like it to be normal pickup for once, two weeks in a row is a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:13:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'll get it sent over now. Have a good afternoon, Barbara."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T13:13:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
